gainful|GENERIC||None||Personalized nutrition products with dietitian support|consumer products, no matching technical proof point|Personalized formulations add SKU complexity that fulfillment has to absorb without errors.
serif-health|GENERIC||None|RAG|Healthcare price transparency data products and APIs|large-scale data engineering on payer files, no proof point is the same problem|Price transparency files run to terabytes, and mapping negotiated rates to real providers is the hard part.
rootly|AGENT_EVAL||Moderate|CODE|AI-native on-call and incident response|incident response agents need trustworthy investigation output -> P3|AI incident responders lose on-call trust when root cause suggestions are confidently wrong during a live outage.
parallel-bio|GENERIC||None||Human immune system models for drug discovery|wet lab biology, no ML proof point|Human immune organoids only replace animal studies if their responses track real clinical outcomes.
drip-capital|GENERIC||None||Trade finance for small businesses|fintech lending, no matching technical proof point|Cross-border invoice financing depends on verifying shipments and buyers across very different trade documents.
spur|CODE||Strong|AGENT_EVAL|AI QA engineer that tests websites from natural language|software testing agents -> P3 coding|Natural-language test agents lose trust when flaky UI assertions outnumber real regressions.
liv-labs-inc|GENERIC||None||Pelvic floor fitness device for women|consumer health hardware, no ML proof point|Proving pelvic floor benefit from a resistance device depends on clinical measures that users rarely track.
poko|GENERIC||None||Fiat-to-crypto onramp aggregator|payments routing, no matching technical proof point|Onramp aggregation success rates depend on routing each payment method to the provider least likely to decline it.
cheetah|GENERIC||None||Wholesale ordering and delivery for small businesses|logistics, no matching technical proof point|Wholesale delivery to small businesses lives on order density per route.
videogen|GENERIC||None|VOICE_EXCLUDED|Generating finished videos from prompts, scripts or articles|generative video assembly on third-party models, no proof point is the same problem|Matching b-roll to each script beat is where generated explainer videos most often feel off.
haplotype-labs|GENERIC||None||Genetic risk prediction and data platform for labs and practices|genomics software, no matching technical proof point|Polygenic risk scores lose accuracy for ancestries underrepresented in the models' training cohorts.
parallel|AGENT_EVAL|P4|Strong|RAG|Computer-use agents that automate medical coding in legacy hospital software|computer-use agents in legacy software need eval harnesses -> P3|Medical coding agents driving legacy hospital screens need replayable evals, since UI changes and coding errors both hit revenue.
status|GENERIC||None|AGENT_EVAL|Social media simulation game set in fantasy worlds|consumer AI game, no proof point is the same problem|AI characters in a social sim have to stay in persona across thousands of interactions per user.
runway|GENERIC||None|CODE|Mobile release management across app stores|release tooling without an AI agent core|Coordinating staged rollouts across app stores depends on catching crash spikes before rollout widens.
